# Testing & Quality

- Reduce likelihood of bugs; detect, recover, report—do not claim zero bugs.
- Pyramid: many fast unit → integration at boundaries → few E2E for critical journeys.
- Aim ≥70% on critical business logic; always test failure paths for auth/payments/mutations.
- Isolate external HTTP/payments/email with doubles; never hit prod DB.
- Before done: lint/types, build, relevant tests, happy/fail paths, CODEMAP/docs if structure changed.

